  "body_html": "<h3>Link - <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1U1hxDFaF5hhBF4_OYiDZjyJx90o68wqjbHokU1S0F3w/edit?usp=sharing\">Market Monitor</a></h3><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><div class=\"image-link image2\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!6Sa_!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F4c3566d1-5ea1-4b2f-8137-d64757bf7ae2_1515x114.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!6Sa_!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F4c3566d1-5ea1-4b2f-8137-d64757bf7ae2_1515x114.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!6Sa_!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F4c3566d1-5ea1-4b2f-8137-d64757bf7ae2_1515x114.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!6Sa_!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F4c3566d1-5ea1-4b2f-8137-d64757bf7ae2_1515x114.png 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!6Sa_!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F4c3566d1-5ea1-4b2f-8137-d64757bf7ae2_1515x114.png\" width=\"1456\" height=\"110\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/4c3566d1-5ea1-4b2f-8137-d64757bf7ae2_1515x114.png&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:110,&quot;width&quot;:1456,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:null,&quot;bytes&quot;:10127,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:false,&quot;topImage&quot;:true,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:null,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\" class=\"sizing-normal\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!6Sa_!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F4c3566d1-5ea1-4b2f-8137-d64757bf7ae2_1515x114.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!6Sa_!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F4c3566d1-5ea1-4b2f-8137-d64757bf7ae2_1515x114.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!6Sa_!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F4c3566d1-5ea1-4b2f-8137-d64757bf7ae2_1515x114.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!6Sa_!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F4c3566d1-5ea1-4b2f-8137-d64757bf7ae2_1515x114.png 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\" fetchpriority=\"high\"></picture><div></div></div></div></figure></div><p>Click the “Market Monitor” link above to go to my Market Monitor spreadsheet, where you can view the current index trend and market breadth readings that come directly from my charting platform. </p><p>With market monitor, I’m like your flight captain. When we experience rough air, you are advised to take a seat and fasten your seatbelt, because things might get bumpy. Once the rough air has passed, it’s safe to move about the cabin.  In much the same way, when we experience a rough market environment, it is advised to take a much more defensive posture to protect yourself from getting tossed around.</p><p>In using the market breadth method for over a decade, I’ve learned to trust the numbers. I hope to help you also trust the process and the numbers as well. The method has served me quite well to stay on the correct side of the market through a number of bulls, bears, and everything in between.</p><h3>What is Breadth?</h3><p>To be clear up-front - breadth is <em><strong>not a market timing tool</strong></em>.  Although it does a pretty damn good job of nailing the tops and bottoms of swings within a few days, its purpose is to identify growing and waning participation in a move. As @amberXBT noted recently on Twitter, we should use “<em><strong>general market indices like SPY, QQQ, IWM, MDY for overall trend and breadth for large, mid and small caps in relation to NHs/NLs for watching participation within that trend and for gauging the health and strength of the overall trend.</strong></em>”  Well said!</p><p>Breadth compares the number of stocks rising versus the number of stocks falling. My method compares the number of stocks making a 10-day New High within the last 2 sessions vs the number of stocks making a 10-day New Low within the last 2 sessions. Why 10 days? Experience using this indicator for the last decade. Why within the last 2 sessions? Again, experience.  This introduces a smoothing effect similar to a moving average.  It reduces the number of false signals and makes it a more reliable gauge.</p><h3>Breadth Variations</h3><p>I use breadth as one of my primary indicators of what kind of market environment I’m currently operating in. I firmly believe that many trading errors are eliminated by simply understanding the current environment and trading accordingly. </p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!2m8i!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F45d72fd8-c811-4623-82c6-2e26c91124b0_1376x432.png\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!2m8i!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F45d72fd8-c811-4623-82c6-2e26c91124b0_1376x432.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!2m8i!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F45d72fd8-c811-4623-82c6-2e26c91124b0_1376x432.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!2m8i!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F45d72fd8-c811-4623-82c6-2e26c91124b0_1376x432.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!2m8i!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F45d72fd8-c811-4623-82c6-2e26c91124b0_1376x432.png 1456w\" sizes=\"auto, 100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!2m8i!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F45d72fd8-c811-4623-82c6-2e26c91124b0_1376x432.png\" width=\"1376\" height=\"432\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/45d72fd8-c811-4623-82c6-2e26c91124b0_1376x432.png&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:432,&quot;width&quot;:1376,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:null,&quot;bytes&quot;:66003,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:true,&quot;topImage&quot;:false,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:null,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\" class=\"sizing-normal\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!2m8i!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F45d72fd8-c811-4623-82c6-2e26c91124b0_1376x432.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!2m8i!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F45d72fd8-c811-4623-82c6-2e26c91124b0_1376x432.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!2m8i!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F45d72fd8-c811-4623-82c6-2e26c91124b0_1376x432.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!2m8i!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F45d72fd8-c811-4623-82c6-2e26c91124b0_1376x432.png 1456w\" sizes=\"auto, 100vw\" loading=\"lazy\"></picture><div class=\"image-link-expand\"><div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset\"><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke=\"var(--color-fg-primary)\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" class=\"icon-noB79L\"><g><path d=\"M2.53001 7.81595C3.49179 4.73911 6.43281 2.5 9.91173 2.5C13.1684 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882\"></path></g></svg></button><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2 icon-noB79L\"><polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"></polyline><polyline points=\"9 21 3 21 3 15\"></polyline><line x1=\"21\" x2=\"14\" y1=\"3\" y2=\"10\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"10\" y1=\"21\" y2=\"14\"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a></figure></div><p>There are basically 5 ways breadth evolves over time:</p><ol><li><p>NHs expanding, NLs contracting with NHs exceeding NLs</p><ol><li><p>Interpretation: Bullish backdrop</p></li><li><p>Action: Aggressive longs, no shorts</p></li></ol></li><li><p>NLs expanding, NHs contracting with NLs exceeding NHs</p><ol><li><p>Interpretation: Bearish backdrop</p></li><li><p>Action: Aggressive shorts, no longs</p></li></ol></li><li><p>NH contracting, but still above NLs number</p><ol><li><p>Interpretation: Contraction/pullback in uptrend</p></li><li><p>Action: Defensive longs, no shorts</p></li></ol></li><li><p>NLs contracting, but still above NHs number</p><ol><li><p>Interpretation: Contraction/pullback in downtrend</p></li><li><p>Action: Defensive shorts, no longs</p></li></ol></li><li><p>Mixed NHs and NLs values across sectors or market caps</p><ol><li><p>Interpretation: Mixed market environment</p></li><li><p>Action: Only trade long in bullish sectors or short bearish sectors or both </p></li></ol></li></ol><p></p><p></p>",
